# Z (15 kg on a 5 mm screw) with its brake: the drive disabled, the brake
# grips (fault0.mot_brake) and Z stays where it was; without a brake it
# runs down to its end stop.
@program mill/mill_sim
@args mill/machine/cn720.mill
lcnc 1
run 0.3
lcnc 0
run 0.5
print tz fault
brake z
@expect mill.tz ~ -20 0.01
